l\" section — sealed prev-gen MacBook Pros at **25–35% off**\n- **Student discount**: ~6% base + bank cashback stackable\n- **Student verification**: Student ID at checkout\n- **Verified prices**: 16\" M1 Max 32GB/1TB at **₹2,14,435** (was ₹3,29,900)\n- **Bank offers**: HSBC Taj 7% EMI, HDFC/ICICI/SBI/Axis up to ₹15,000\n- 🔗 [shop.unicornstore.in](https://shop.unicornstore.in)\n\n#### 2. Aptronix (Pan-India, 60+ stores)\n- **Student program**: [\"Back to Cool\"](https://portal.aptronixindia.com/student-form) portal\n- **Student discount**: **8–10% flat off** MacBook Pro + 15% off third-party accessories + 25% off AppleCare\n- **Bonus**: Lifestyle & education vouchers worth up to **₹40,000**\n- **Verified pricing**: 14\" MBP at ₹2,20,708 (MRP ₹2,39,900) + ₹15,000 bank cashback = **~₹2,05,708 net**\n- **Verification**: College ID + Aadhaar\n- 🔗 [aptronixindia.com](https://www.aptronixindia.com)\n\n#### 3. Imagine Store — Tresor Systems (North/West India)\n- **Student page**: [myimaginestore.com/student-offer](https://www.myimaginestore.com/student-offer)\n- **Student discount**: ~**7% education discount** stackable with bank cashback\n- **Verified pricing**: 14\" MBP net effective **₹2,08,107** (MRP ₹2,39,900); 16\" MBP net **₹3,19,707**\n- **Verification**: Downloadable consent form + college ID\n- 🔗 [myimaginestore.com](https://www.myimaginestore.com)\n\n#### 4. Imagine Online — Ample Technologies (South India/Online)\n- **Student page**: \"Student and Teacher Discounts\" portal\n- **Deals**: \"Timeless Tech Sale\" + seasonal campaigns\n- **Bank offers**: Up to ₹15,000 instant cashback\n- 🔗 [imagineonline.store](https://www.imagineonline.store)\n\n#### 5. iNvent Store (Delhi-NCR/Bangalore)\n- **Student discount**: **8% to 22% off** during student campaigns\n- **Student page**: Interactive Student Enquiry Form\n- **Bank offers**: Up to ₹10,000 cashback + ₹10,000 exchange bonus\n- 🔗 [inventstore.in](https://www.inventstore.in)\n\n#### 6. iVenus (Gujarat/Maharashtra)\n- **Student offers**: Open to Class 9+ students and college students\n- **Clearance**: **\"Hot Deals\" + \"Open Box\"** sections for prev-gen devices\n- **Discount**: ~3%+ student base + bank cashback + trade-in bonus\n- 🔗 [ivenus.in](https://ivenus.in)\n\n---\n\n### 🟡 Tier 2: Good student discounts, no dedicated clearance section\n\n#### 7. iPlanet (South India — TN, KA, KL)\n- **Student page**: Student & Teacher Discounts\n- **Offers**: Up to ₹15,000 bank cashback + ₹10,000 Cashify trade-in\n- **Bonus**: IndiGo BluChips reward accrual\n- 🔗 [iplanet.one](https://iplanet.one)\n\n#### 8. FutureWorld India (Pan-India)\n- **Student page**: [\"Student Corner\"](https://www.futureworldindia.in/student-corner)\n- **Offers**: Up to ₹15,000 bank cashback + exchange bonus\n- 🔗 [futureworldindia.in](https://www.futureworldindia.in)\n\n#### 9. iTech (East India)\n- **Student page**: 5-step Student/Teacher verification portal\n- **Discount**: **3% to 15%** on select Macs\n- **Clearance**: Demo/display units (location dependent)\n- 🔗 [itechstore.co.in](https://itechstore.co.in)\n\n#### 10. iCrest (North/East India)\n- **Student pag